&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;-12:00进行&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:宋体&quot;&gt;面试。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(34, 32, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:黑体&quot;&gt;三、材料准备&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;请所有参加考试的考生务必提前准备相关材料&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;原件及复印件&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;以备核验，具体包括：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;1.身份证（原件、复印件1份）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;个人简历（含近期免冠证件照）（&lt;/span&gt;1份，正反面打印）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;《山东大学招聘非事业编制人员报名表》（&lt;/span&gt;1份，正反面打印）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;本科、研究生学习阶段的学历及学位证书，以及其他资格证书。海外取得学历学位的，须提供海外各学历阶段教育部留学服务中心出具的《国（境）外学历学位认证书》；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;届毕业生如暂未取得毕业证和学位证，可提供毕业生就业推荐表或学信网的在读证明&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;英语水平证书&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;党员须提供中共党员证明（落款时间在&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;年&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;月以后）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;7.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;其他资格证书&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;、工作经历证明&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;等（原件、复印件&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;1份）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;考生须保证材料的真实性和有效性，材料不全或经审核后发现不符合应聘条件的，取消考试资格。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(34, 32, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;四、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(34, 32, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:黑体&quot;&gt;注意事项&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;1.请考生务必携带身份证、黑色签字笔、2B铅笔、橡皮等考试必备用具参加笔试；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;请考生自行打印并携带该&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;考试&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;通知；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;考生须出示身份证与纸质版&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;考试&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;通知步行入校。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;因考点停车场地有限，无法提供停车位，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;外来车辆不能进入校园&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 33px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;请&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;参加笔试人员&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;月&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;日&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;:40前到达考场，主动出示身份证，配合工作人员进行身份核验、签到，并按座号（即笔试入围人员名单对应序号）就坐。笔试开考15分钟后，迟到考生不准进入考场&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:仿宋_GB2312&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
